  "title": "UK and Israel Respond to Settlement Sanctions: UK Consulate Closure and UK Mission Rebranding",
  "summary": "The UK announced a trade ban on goods from illegal Israeli settlements in the West Bank, prompting Israel to close its British consulate in East Jerusalem. The move is part of broader efforts to address settler violence and counter Israeli policies toward Palestinians. The UK and Israel are responding to the UK’s stance on 'ethnic cleansing' and the impact of settlement policies on Palestinians.",
